---
description: >-
  Routes edits of soft-linked Cursor skills/rules to the cursor-packs submodule
  workflow. Apply when changing .cursor/skills or .cursor/rules, or when paths
  resolve into .cursor/packs/shared.
globs:
  - .cursor/skills/**
  - .cursor/rules/**
  - .cursor/packs/shared/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Soft-linked cursor-packs

- Before editing under `.cursor/skills/` or `.cursor/rules/`, MUST check whether the path is a symlink into `.cursor/packs/shared/`.
- If it is pack-linked: MUST follow `.cursor/skills/edit-cursor-packs/SKILL.md` (branch/commit in **cursor-packs**, then bump the consumer submodule). MUST NOT treat the path as a normal consumer-owned file.
- If it is a real file/directory: it is a consumer overlay; edit and commit in the consumer repo.
- New shared skill/rule names MUST be added to `.cursor/packs/shared/scripts/link-into-project.sh` allow-lists and the link script re-run in consumers.
